diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 4479b53..0092ea9 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -2,6 +2,16 @@
 
 This project is a sample news application built with Astro, designed to serve as a testing ground for new features in Chrome DevTools.
 
+Page navigation uses native cross-document view transitions, respecting reduced
+motion preferences and falling back to normal navigation in unsupported browsers.
+The shared head keeps critical styles render-blocking and uses `rel="expect"` to
+wait for each page's `initial-view-ready` marker after its initial visible content.
+Place this marker before below-the-fold sections on new pages. The initial layout
+is server-rendered; React hydration adds interactions without changing that layout.
+If a script is added that changes the initial appearance, put it in the head with
+`blocking="render"` so it loads and executes before the transition. Keep analytics
+and ad loaders non-blocking.
+
 
 ```sh
 pnpm install && pnpm run start
